+++
title: Leadership
hook: Do you dread the version of yourself your team sees on a bad day?
hook2: Or have you stopped noticing which version shows up at all?
+++

Leadership coaching here covers influence, business, and career — the
questions that come up when you're responsible for a team, a company, or
just the direction of your own working life. Sessions are one-on-one and
built around whatever's actually stuck, not a fixed curriculum.
